 "what": "eager tree decode plus walk plus destruction of one whole document, per document. A, A2 = cbor::decode of a10dabc built twice (noise floor). X1 = a10dabc with each scalar child of a container written once: the union value is computed first, then the item is placed (a10dabc places the item with u64 and zeroed rest, then writes the value again). X2 = X1 plus half floats read by std::bit_cast<std::float16_t> to double after the NaN check (one vcvtsh2sd in place of the branches of float_decode_binary16 and vcvtsh2ss + vcvtss2sd). X3 = a10dabc decode, walk reads each getter once (no second text_string().value()). MPI = msgpack::unpack (v2 create_object_visitor) and a walk on rotating copies. All CBOR arms keep every check of cbor::decode.",
